WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.776
Tomorrow is packed. Dayweave connects Gmail, Google Calendar, and Google Sheets to

2
00:00:05.776 --> 00:00:08.633
make room for coffee, lunch, and rest.

3
00:00:08.633 --> 00:00:11.959
This walkthrough uses clearly labeled sample data.

4
00:00:11.959 --> 00:00:15.449
Gemini reviews minimized signals through read-only tools.

5
00:00:15.449 --> 00:00:20.184
Scheduling rules validate the times, and this activity trace shows the calls.

6
00:00:20.184 --> 00:00:22.714
Each suggestion explains its evidence.

7
00:00:22.714 --> 00:00:27.000
Food ideas start with a goal you choose: include more protein.

8
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:31.020
Recent receipt patterns suggest familiar options at Starbucks and Chipotle, plus a

9
00:00:31.020 --> 00:00:33.184
reminder for your next Costco trip.

10
00:00:33.184 --> 00:00:35.714
These are menu ideas, not food orders.

11
00:00:35.714 --> 00:00:38.551
Ingredients and availability still need checking.

12
00:00:38.551 --> 00:00:42.755
Receipts don't prove what someone ate, or whether they're protein deficient.

13
00:00:42.755 --> 00:00:47.796
That distinction keeps suggestions useful without pretending to know your entire diet.

14
00:00:47.796 --> 00:00:50.755
The monthly calculator makes assumptions explicit.

15
00:00:50.755 --> 00:00:54.571
Ten kilograms of dry rice, shared by two people over thirty days,

16
00:00:54.571 --> 00:00:58.694
gives this conditional estimate. Change the amount eaten to five kilograms, and

17
00:00:58.694 --> 00:00:59.367
the result halves.

18
00:00:59.367 --> 00:01:02.061
Now protect the lunch break.

19
00:01:02.061 --> 00:01:06.306
Select it, review the exact calendar event and Sheets activity entry, then

20
00:01:06.306 --> 00:01:09.490
confirm. The sample event appears in the schedule.

21
00:01:09.490 --> 00:01:13.408
Repeat the approval, and the existing reservation is recognized without creating a

22
00:01:13.408 --> 00:01:16.796
duplicate. The activity log keeps one record.

23
00:01:16.796 --> 00:01:21.358
Real Google integrations were tested separately; wearable data remains a future connection.
